## RelationType: enabled by

Source IRI: `https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/enabledBy`. Source definition: relation from one capability to another capability such that associated performance of the first capability is made possible by another. This BKN projection stores the target entity ID in `enabled_by_target_id`.

### Endpoint

| Source | Target | Type |
|--------|--------|------|
| capability | capability | direct |

### Mapping Rules

| Source Property | Target Property |
|-----------------|-----------------|
| enabled_by_target_id | entity_id |
